'''Flame Patch''' (Japanese: '''フレイムパッチ''' ''Flame Patch'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=Attach a {{e|Fire}} Energy from your discard pile to your Active {{e|Fire}} Pokémon.
}}

