==Trivia==
This card's effect is similar to multiple cards in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]: {{TCG|Dark Patch}}, {{TCG|Aqua Patch}}, {{TCG|Metal Saucer}}, and {{TCG|Wondrous Patch}}, though it attaches {{e|Fire}} Energy. Unlike the aforementioned cards, Flame Patch attaches Energy to an Active Pokémon instead of a Benched Pokémon.

